---
title: Tomato Salad with Walnut and Pomegranate Molasses
description: A more elaborate tomato salad from the Istanbul restaurant Hamdi
source: Planet Barbecue! <urn:isbn:9780761148012
author: Steven Raichlen
course: Side
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Easy
prep time: 15m
cuisine: Turkish
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
- turkish
- savoury
- side-dish
- salad
- vegetarian
---

Place the @ripe red tomatoes{2}(cut into ¼ inch dice with their juices), @walnuts{0.5%cup}(coarsely chopped), @sweet onion{0.5%cup}(cut into fine dice), @flat-leaf parsley{0.25%cup}(finely chopped), @olive oil{2%tbsp}, and @pomegranate molasses{2%tbsp} in a non-reactive mixing bowl. Toss to mix, then season with @coarse salt{} and @black pepper{}(freshly ground) to taste.